  "FolderHelpContent": "Application Data Root\n  %APPDATA%\\Wend\\\n\nThis folder is the app's working root (appDataPath).\nAt startup the app opens with no project loaded.\nUse Project > Project List to open a named project.\n\n── Named Projects ─────────────────────────────────\n  projects\\                  (named projects container)\n  ├── default\\               Your main project\n  │   ├── data\\              Node / tree data files\n  │   │   └── default.promptsbt   (main tree)\n  │   ├── history\\           Execution history runs\n  │   ├── blobs\\             Media attachments\n  │   ├── providers.json     AI provider settings\n  │   ├── recipes.json       Pipeline recipes\n  │   └── session.json       Tab / session state\n  └── samples_radio\\          Sample project (radio)\n\nEach subdirectory of projects\\ is one named project.\nThe folder name is the project name shown in the list.\n\n── Other files in %APPDATA%\\Wend\\ ─────────────\nconfig.json  Bootstrap config (projectsRoot setting)\nOther *.json files at the root are legacy residue\nfrom older versions and are not used by the app.\n\n── Changing the Root Location ────────────────────\nConfig > General > Projects Root Folder\nRestart required after changing.",
